ter(DPF) at certain \\\\nlevel, DPF regeneration warning lamp \\\\nwill be on.\\\\nDPF regeneration warning lamp will be \\\\noff as soon as DPF regeneration process \\\\nis done.\\\\n▶DPF REGENERATION PROCESS AND LAMPS\\\\nThis lamp is on during DPF regeneration \\\\nprocess.\\\\n7\\\\n\uf06c\\\\nBe careful with muffler and exhaust gas \\\\nduring DPF regeneration process since \\\\nthey are extremely hot.\\\\nWARNING\\\\n\uf06c\\\\nPerform DPF regeneration process when \\\\nDPF warning lamp is on.\\\\nThe engine RPM may go down until DPF \\\\nregeneration process is done.\\\\nWARNING\\"\\n}", "id": "lc_8974f73b-1636-40d9-bb40-4111d7d1bedf"}, {"type": "text", "text": "{\\n  \\"score\\": 0.6664747595787048,\\n  \\"source_file\\": \\"D:\\\\\\\\Rag_pipeline\\\\\\\\t130sp_na_operator_manual.pdf\\",\\n  \\"page_number\\": 52,\\n  \\"chunk_id\\": 90,\\n  \\"text\\": \\"TRACTOR INSTRUMENTS\\\\nC\\\\n4\\\\n▶HAZARD WARNING SWITCH\\\\nPress the hazard warning switch in \\\\nemergency to warn other vehicles in \\\\norder to prevent an accident.\\\\nThe hazard flasher is operated \\\\nregardless of the position of the start \\\\nswitch.\\\\nAlso, the turn signal lamp function is \\\\ndisabled while the hazard flasher is \\\\nactive.\\\\n•\\\\nPosition A: OFF\\\\n•\\\\nPosition B: The hazard flasher is \\\\nactivated and turn signal lamps on \\\\nthe cluster blink as well.\\\\n▶DPF REGENERATION SWITCH\\\\nPerform following steps when DPF \\\\nwarning lamp is on.\\\\n1.\\\\nPark the tractor on level surface \\\\nwith parking brake applied.\\\\n2.\\\\nIdle the engine for 3 ~ 4 min.\\\\n3.\\\\nPress DPF regeneration switch for 3 \\\\nsec. to active DPF regeneration \\\\nprocess.\\\\nDPF regeneration lamp will be on.\\\\n4.\\\\nAfter the end of DPF regeneration \\\\nprocess, DPF warning lamp goes off.\\\\n•\\\\nREMOTE 3P UP / DOWN SWITCHES\\\\nThree point linkage(3P) will be raised or\\"\\n}", "id": "lc_e7b90c9f-cf72-46bf-b294-3cbde0a28a19"}, {"type": "text", "text": "{\\n  \\"score\\": 0.6634430885314941,\\n  \\"source_file\\": \\"D:\\\\\\\\Rag_pipeline\\\\\\\\t130sp_na_operator_manual.pdf\\",\\n  \\"page_number\\": 65,\\n  \\"chunk_id\\": 109,\\n  \\"text\\": \\"•\\\\nYellow lamp ON: 10% of urea in tank\\\\n•\\\\nRed lamp ON: 5% of urea in tank\\\\n•\\\\nRed lamp blinking: 2.5% of urea in \\\\ntank\\\\n17\\\\nCOLOR LAMP\\\\nSCR WARNING\\\\nLAMP\\\\nDPF MALFUNCTION\\\\nLAMP\\\\nDPF WARNING LAMP DPF REGEN. LAMP\\\\n\uf06c\\\\nMuffler and exhaust gas are very hot \\\\nwhile DPF regeneration process is on \\\\nprogress.\\\\nWARNING\\"\\n}", "id": "lc_2e46a7ab-bfc0-4bae-a61f-5d669e187d8b"}, {"type": "text", "text": "{\\n  \\"score\\": 0.6476731300354004,\\n  \\"source_file\\": \\"D:\\\\\\\\Rag_pipeline\\\\\\\\t130sp_na_operator_manual.pdf\\",\\n  \\"page_number\\": 65,\\n  \\"chunk_id\\": 108,\\n  \\"text\\": \\"TRACTOR INSTRUMENTS\\\\nC\\\\nC\\\\n▶SCR WARNING LAMP, DPF \\\\nMALFUNCTIONING LAMP\\\\n•\\\\nSCR WARNING LAMP\\\\nThis comes on when SCR(Selective \\\\nCatalytic Reduction) parts are \\\\nmalfunctioning.\\\\nGet service at workshop.\\\\n•\\\\nDPF MALFUNCTIONING LAMP\\\\nThis comes on when DPF parts are \\\\nmalfunctioning.\\\\nGet service at workshop.\\\\n▶DPF WARNING LAMP, DPF \\\\nREGEN. LAMP\\\\n•\\\\nDPF WARNING LAMP\\\\nIt blinks when the DPF regeneration \\\\nprocess is required.\\\\n•\\\\nDPF REGEN. LAMP\\\\nIt comes on while DPF regeneration \\\\nprocess is on progress.\\\\n▶UREA LEVEL LAMPS\\\\nThis indicates the amount of urea while \\\\nthe start switch is in the \\\\\\"ON\\\\\\" position.\\\\n•\\\\n4 green lamps ON: 75% - 100% of \\\\nurea in tank\\\\n•\\\\n3 green lamps ON: 50% - 75% of urea \\\\nin tank\\\\n•\\\\n2 green lamps ON: 25% - 50% of urea \\\\nin tank\\\\n•\\\\n1 green lamp ON: 25% of urea in tank\\\\n•\\\\nYellow lamp ON: 10% of urea in tank\\\\n•\\\\nRed lamp ON: 5% of urea in tank\\\\n•\\\\nRed lamp blinking: 2.5% of urea in \\\\ntank\\\\n17\\\\nCOLOR LAMP\\"\\n}", "id": "lc_e6f580c2-9f91-4098-8bf7-06439c61fa30"}]', violations=['NSFWText'], message_type=NSFWText
