2026-07-20 22:23:32 | INFO     | pipelines.agent_pipeline.shared.safety_output_nodes:run:84 | Output safety passed: text='It seems there was an issue with retrieving the specific information about the DPF warning lamp from the manual. However, I can still provide you with a general explanation.\n\nThe DPF (Diesel Particulate Filter) warning lamp typically indicates that there is an issue with the diesel particulate filter, which is a component in the exhaust system designed to reduce soot emissions. When the DPF warning lamp illuminates, it usually means that the filter needs to be cleaned or regenerated, or there might be a fault in the system.\n\nFor more detailed information, you can refer to the operator manual or consult a service professional. If you need more specific guidance, let me know, and I can try to find more relevant information.'
2026-07-20 22:23:32 | INFO     | pipelines.agent_pipeline.shared.safety_output_nodes:run:104 | Output PII check passed: text='It seems there was an issue with retrieving the specific information about the DPF warning lamp from the manual. However, I can still provide you with a general explanation.\n\nThe DPF (Diesel Particulate Filter) warning lamp typically indicates that there is an issue with the diesel particulate filter, which is a component in the exhaust system designed to reduce soot emissions. When the DPF warning lamp illuminates, it usually means that the filter needs to be cleaned or regenerated, or there might be a fault in the system.\n\nFor more detailed information, you can refer to the operator manual or consult a service professional. If you need more specific guidance, let me know, and I can try to find more relevant information.'
